{
  "_id": "tg-god-privilege-of-seeing",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "I have seen God face to face, Gen. 32:30. Moses … was afraid to look upon God, Ex. 3:6. Lord will come down in the sight of all the people, Ex. 19:11. charge the people, lest they break through unto the Lord to gaze, Ex. 19:21. nobles of the children of Israel … saw God, Ex. 24:11. Lord spake unto Moses face to face, Ex. 33:11. there shall no man see me, and live, Ex. 33:20. With him will I speak mouth to mouth, Num. 12:8. Moses, whom the Lord knew face to face, Deut. 34:10. We shall surely die, because we have seen God, Judg. 13:22. Lord … had appeared unto him twice, 1 Kgs. 11:9. in my flesh shall I see God, Job 19:26 (Moses 5:10). mine eyes have seen … the Lord, Isa. 6:5.",
